### 1. Basic search by movie name
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=batman
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search with year and movie name
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=batman&Year=2005
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search with movie name and type
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=game&Type=series
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search with page 1
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=batman&Page=1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search with page 2
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=batman&Page=2
Accept: application/json

### 6. Full search
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=inception&Year=2010&Type=movie&Page=1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Exception
GET {{Api_Host}}/movies/search?Text=
Accept: application/json

###

@Api_Host = http://localhost:5162